contractDefault.description:
The fields in this section allow you to set default templates to use for this item when the item is selected in a contract line or as an expense. The user can override these defaults on the contract line or expense.
For Non-Inventory (Purchase only) items, only the Expense template fields are applicable. 
This section is not applicable to Kit and Stockable kit items;
